    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>SPEAKER 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And I'm just gonna impose a note of historical fact here is that Abigail and I wanted to bring them separate, just because of the mint perfect. I was like, I don't want them to touch it. We have been to Tacloban, and we have seen the Imelda Museum in Tacloban, which includes</Text>
