      <Text>love to, before we get to that, can I just say one other note directly from Makati, the supermodels, and Makati, it's EMA Marcos, and they use the words fag hag directly. I mean, okay, so she is that's Aimee is well known for this, so I feel like there's a confusion about the sister and mother, the daughter and the mother in this depiction about what's what. Anyway, sorry to interrupt. Please go ahead.</Text>
