    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But like, did just, like some outreach, oh, she was fabulous. Let this fabulous musical, right? And then wrote it. Brought, brought in fat boy, slim to write it. They wrote it, yeah. And then they brought the bin. They brought in a Filipino consultant, who, I think was Alex's mom, who was like, Do you know this was a dictator? And they're like, no, oh, so</Text>
