      <Text>Yeah, we went to closing when?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>SPEAKER 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah, when? So it was like a lot of Filipino people in the opening the audience, yeah, when? That moment where the drag version introduced Imelda, there were audible like, booze, oh, and no cheers, oh, in opening night, yeah. And the drag queen was like,</Text>
