      <Text>was a true story. She thought that it says this is a true story. So she believed it. And like, wow. And like, came from Japan, I think, Oh, wow. And like, and yeah, and died. But there was, like,</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>UNKNOWN SPEAKER</Text>
