    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>yeah, but there's like, the real, like, fake story that is, like, she was just this delusional woman that, like, which is not the correct story, but it's all these people, like, trying to, like, maybe deal with their own story as they're having to relive the story told about them over and over. So the you</Text>
    </Paragraph>
